# Trial by Lightning (otherAreas 27), the battlefield's arms without a win. Accepted without the fork: LP_Entrance
# opens no menu (the fork is required). Available with the fork: no menu (BattlefieldQuest's entry wants the status at
# accepted or more; a status read that stays in Lua). Accepted with the fork: entered (the fork taken), then left
# through Lightning_Protocrystal (32003, option 4: leaveBattlefield): no 32001, no whisper; Ripapa then sees neither key
# item: 10024 (a new fork).
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning accepted
login
trigger LP_Entrance                       # accepted, no fork: no menu
finish-if-event
keyitem TuningForkOfLightning
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning available
trigger LP_Entrance                       # available, the fork: no menu
finish-if-event
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning accepted
trigger LP_Entrance                       # accepted, the fork: 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
trigger Lightning_Protocrystal            # the exit: 32003
finish option=4                           # left: no win
warp 30.6,-15.6,56.0 Mhaura
trigger Ripapa                            # accepted, neither key item: 10024
finish                                    # a new fork
